[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m form feed, carriage return — before converting. The Rust `Scanner::scan_i32`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m skips exactly that set via `is_space`. Verified with inputs such as
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `"\n\n\n\n42"`, `"\t\t7"`, `"  \t\r\n  12\n"`.
