[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    100[0m:[38;5;10m[49m standard. It is pinned by a test rather than by the language, and a different
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    101[0m:[38;5;10m[49m compiler or optimization level could in principle change the C side.
